<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wells Fargo cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wells Fargo cut to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said Wednesday it downgraded Wells Fargo Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier today, Wells Fargo said its second quarter earnings per share would likely come in $1 below analysts' estimates of $3.53 per share due to integration costs related to its merger with First Interstate Bancorp.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 14-3/4 to 264-1/4.</p>
</text>
